{"id":"a82021b6-12cf-458e-98d3-9391063a9c2f","title":"Floating Glass 1","slug":"floating-glass-1","collectionSlug":"floating-glass","collectionName":"Floating Glass","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A dynamic shader effect featuring a prominent triangular glass element positioned in the center-right area of the composition. The background is dominated by deep dark-blue to black tones creating a night-like atmosphere. A flowing gradient with purple (#9000ff), white, and gray tones creates organic, wave-like patterns that move across the canvas with soft, blurred edges. The glass triangle element exhibits strong refraction properties with a high refraction value (0.86), creating a lens-like distortion effect that bends and refracts the underlying gradient patterns. The triangle has a subtle fresnel effect with white highlights along its edges, giving it dimensional depth and a glossy appearance. A tritone color mapping overlays the entire composition, mapping dark navy (#1a1c38) to shadows, vibrant purple (#9000ff) to midtones, and cyan (#e3ffff) to highlights, creating a cohesive color grading. The dither effect adds subtle blue noise texture with a threshold of 0.62, creating a grainy, slightly noisy quality that prevents banding. Soft edge transitions and a 0.15 edge softness on the glass create smooth, anti-aliased boundaries. The overall mood is ethereal and futuristic, with a sense of movement and energy flowing through the composition. The lighting angle of 276 degrees creates directional highlights on the glass surface.","colors":["#0a0015","#9000ff","#e3ffff","#1a1c38","#ffffff","#9c9c9c"],"labels":["gradient","organic","3d","dark"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/a82021b6-12cf-458e-98d3-9391063a9c2f.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"Circle","id":"idmnayde0qhf56tj00g","_key":"key_1774739997242_0.723270190112322","props":{"color":"#ffffff","center":{"x":1,"y":0.5},"radius":3,"opacity":1,"visible":false,"maskType":"alpha","soft